{"data":{"body":"[P2] Keep object previews budget-bounded\n\n`buildPreview(Object, ...)` still converts the entire value into a `JsonNode` before applying the 4 KB budget. Large object graphs are fully duplicated and can exhaust heap even when the preview is tiny; only the JSON-string overload is streamed. Feed object serialization into the bounded streaming collector and add a multi-megabyte object-field regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ogZeQ","finding_digest":"5569849aaa6f231cfcab68b6fef126eb700831658d28e1c3d0a4d8d653c1b3aa","finding_id":"arf_v1_kvuyjgvkn4rrz7flnc3p54jg5n","finding_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview::budgeted-traversal","identity_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview::budgeted-traversal","line":44,"observation_digest":"a0cb38c1225ce22527ee8271680f4245458894268405bd41bbcb3b8c5d2c9227","observation_id":"aro_v1_udftrqjcltrckj7oqjywqd2civ","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/SerDesPreview.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kvuyjgvkn4rrz7flnc3p54jg5n","published_at":"2026-09-01T04:36:02Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lg7klicms47wv6riosxce65qkn","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"f1e9928dd8b85e6321366254d10182fc54aafb83","reviewer":"codex","start_line":44,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_pecxtn7jkbxkmkdwylfhwpcspe","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T04:36:02Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
